          Battery blowers now move as much air as many gas handhelds. The trick is matching airflow and battery capacity to your yard, so you finish the job before the charge runs out.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
          <a
            href="#ego-lb6504-cordless"
            class="px-8 py-4 bg-[#FF4500] hover:bg-[#E63E00] text-white font-black rounded-xl shadow-lg transition-all no-underline"
